ders</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/staticContent/documents/forum_om.pdf" target="_blank">Regulations Page</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/procedure-forms" >Procedure &amp; Forms</a> </li> </ul> </li> <li style="margin-left: -16px; font-size:13px;"><a class="nav-link dropdown-toggle" > Employee Corner</a> <ul> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/employee-arena" >Employee Arena <i class="fa fa-caret-right"></i></a> <ul> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/applications"" >Applications<span class="pull-right"></span></a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/policies"" >Policies Guidelines<span class="pull-right"></span></a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/accounts"" >Accounts Budget<span class="pull-right"></span></a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/annual-budget-estimates"" >Annual Budget Estimates<span class="pull-right"></span></a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/income-tax-performa"" >Income Tax Performa<span class="pull-right"></span></a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/annual"" >Annual Conf. Report<span class="pull-right"></span></a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/best-practices"" >Best Practices<span class="pull-right"></span></a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/suggestions"" >Suggestions<span class="pull-right"></span></a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/training"" >Training<span class="pull-right"></span></a> </li> </ul> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/transfer-orders" >Transfer Orders <i class="fa fa-caret-right"></i></a> <ul> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/gazetted"" >Gazetted<span class="pull-right"></span></a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.dhbvn.org.in/web/portal/se-hr"" >SE-HR<span class="pull-right"></span></a> </li> </ul> </li> <li> <a href="https://ww